{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國財政部10月22日提出一項新的監管規則，計劃進一步限制美國企業和個人向中國、俄羅斯、伊朗、朝鮮、古巴等被美國列為「受關注國家」的對象進行特定高科技投資。新規旨在防止美國資本幫助相關國家提升軍事能力、發展先進技術及擴大情報和監控能力，也是美國持續強化對外投資國家安全審查的一部分。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583494.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:54:59.123967+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:46:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.221125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.221125+00:00","content_hash":"7beb0dfdb6eda457ae62625a32a5b0d1141ea04538a4c10585bfbe2549e805a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}